    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλῐνῳδ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>palinode, recantation</i>,
			first used of an ode by Stesichorus, in which he recanted his attack
			upon Helen, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				10.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				319e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				243b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
